{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025180/extras/c25824a947ffa3612a19d6c85427c6e0.poster.avif?t=1760729328\" width=616 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025180/extras/c25824a947ffa3612a19d6c85427c6e0.webm?t=1760729328\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025180/extras/c25824a947ffa3612a19d6c85427c6e0.mp4?t=1760729328\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SYNOPSIS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>La Salamanca</strong>, you put yourself in the shoes of a young man from Argentina, who after the mysterious disappearance of all his friends during a trip to Santiago del Estero, will have to look for them in their supposed meeting place: An old and dark apartment complex called <i>&quot;El Portal&quot;</i>, a &quot;cozy&quot; place, which is not really what it seems...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inspired by a local legend from Argentina</strong>, you will have to descend deeper and deeper into this place straight out of hell, <strong>running and hiding from its abominations</strong>, to finally reveal the truth of what happened with your colleagues, and what this site is truly hiding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025180/extras/9ffbbd816a8ac7c1f88fee27af7596c9.poster.avif?t=1760729328\" width=616 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025180/extras/9ffbbd816a8ac7c1f88fee27af7596c9.webm?t=1760729328\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025180/extras/9ffbbd816a8ac7c1f88fee27af7596c9.mp4?t=1760729328\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  A <strong>psychological horror game</strong> that immerses you in a story <strong>inspired by a legend from the north of Argentina.</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  A <strong>thrilling atmosphere</strong>\u00a0that will keep even the bravest on their toes throughout the game. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <strong>An episodic structure</strong> where each chapter and level will <strong>have different approaches in their mechanics</strong> to differentiate themselves from each other.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <strong>Multiple puzzles</strong> to sharpen your brain as you <strong>progress through the story and evade monsters.</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <strong>Terrifying monsters and demons</strong>, where you must <strong>develop different tactics</strong> to deal with each of them <strong>based on their behavior and the environment around you.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025180/extras/0b9c1c13d44dd8c1480c5242ea538d40.poster.avif?t=1760729328\" width=616 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025180/extras/0b9c1c13d44dd8c1480c5242ea538d40.webm?t=1760729328\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025180/extras/0b9c1c13d44dd8c1480c5242ea538d40.mp4?t=1760729328\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MADE IN ARGENTINA</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are <strong>Carpincho Studio</strong>, a bunch of young amateur devs from Argentina (Mostly from Rosario). We love games and both playing and developing them is our passion, reason why we decided, as a group, to finally make public our first ever game, <strong>&quot;La Salamanca&quot;</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We also love Capybaras. Best animal ever.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"No going back now.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3025180/91398585a70a91e293ff0065af5a2b3a7d26dfed.jpg"},{"name":"The Portal","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3025180/656b281ac3a9acf70244261346f3c3474baecb21.jpg"},{"name":"The Mansion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3025180/e7d3f022822350a20c3865a1fb1fad79d149180f.jpg"},{"name":"The Parking","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3025180/5c9e3391877b0dcce4cd965795a61d3d2cbd9d76.jpg"},{"name":"The Sewers","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3025180/8c10d2c4549ac86ad5ed4a37c7923cfe7cadd05d.jpg"},{"name":"The Tunels","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3025180/0f7857bd664631a333695db581d46a36b922d790.jpg"},{"name":"Carpincho-a-Thon, Prologue","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3025180/4d568514fce5835a686cc24f1165062274ce30fc.jpg"},{"name":"Carpincho-a-Thon, Part I","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3025180/6371e2ab309f6e77b42ea90de9109ce24125ff65.jpg"},{"name":"Carpincho-a-Thon, Part II","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3025180/aea59fc942bd8ac78a39b5c67187bc986d8c80d8.jpg"},{"name":"Carpincho-a-Thon, Part III","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3025180/dd649cb10cd5882706b17e2bd5651c9565b8a94f.jpg"}],"total":30},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3025180?t=1760729328","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025180/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760729328","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025180/cfaeac2f610e3bfce37817630513f82502864209/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760729328","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025180/cfaeac2f610e3bfce37817630513f82502864209/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760729328","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"\"La Salamanca\" may containt content not apropiate for all ages, containing Frequent Violence or Gore, Strong Horror Themes, Strong Language, and General Mature Content."},"demos":[{"appid":3027520,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025180/extras/c25824a947ffa3612a19d6c85427c6e0.poster.avif?t=1760729328\" width=616 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025180/extras/c25824a947ffa3612a19d6c85427c6e0.webm?t=1760729328\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025180/extras/c25824a947ffa3612a19d6c85427c6e0.mp4?t=1760729328\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SYNOPSIS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>La Salamanca</strong>, you put yourself in the shoes of a young man from Argentina, who after the mysterious disappearance of all his friends during a trip to Santiago del Estero, will have to look for them in their supposed meeting place: An old and dark apartment complex called <i>&quot;El Portal&quot;</i>, a &quot;cozy&quot; place, which is not really what it seems...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inspired by a local legend from Argentina</strong>, you will have to descend deeper and deeper into this place straight out of hell, <strong>running and hiding from its abominations</strong>, to finally reveal the truth of what happened with your colleagues, and what this site is truly hiding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025180/extras/9ffbbd816a8ac7c1f88fee27af7596c9.poster.avif?t=1760729328\" width=616 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025180/extras/9ffbbd816a8ac7c1f88fee27af7596c9.webm?t=1760729328\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025180/extras/9ffbbd816a8ac7c1f88fee27af7596c9.mp4?t=1760729328\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  A <strong>psychological horror game</strong> that immerses you in a story <strong>inspired by a legend from the north of Argentina.</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  A <strong>thrilling atmosphere</strong>\u00a0that will keep even the bravest on their toes throughout the game. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <strong>An episodic structure</strong> where each chapter and level will <strong>have different approaches in their mechanics</strong> to differentiate themselves from each other.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <strong>Multiple puzzles</strong> to sharpen your brain as you <strong>progress through the story and evade monsters.</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <strong>Terrifying monsters and demons</strong>, where you must <strong>develop different tactics</strong> to deal with each of them <strong>based on their behavior and the environment around you.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025180/extras/0b9c1c13d44dd8c1480c5242ea538d40.poster.avif?t=1760729328\" width=616 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025180/extras/0b9c1c13d44dd8c1480c5242ea538d40.webm?t=1760729328\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025180/extras/0b9c1c13d44dd8c1480c5242ea538d40.mp4?t=1760729328\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MADE IN ARGENTINA</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are <strong>Carpincho Studio</strong>, a bunch of young amateur devs from Argentina (Mostly from Rosario). We love games and both playing and developing them is our passion, reason why we decided, as a group, to finally make public our first ever game, <strong>&quot;La Salamanca&quot;</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We also love Capybaras. Best animal ever.</p>","developers":["Carpincho Studio"],"dlc":[4058950],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025180/header.jpg?t=1760729328","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","r